      "text": "Spend time relaxing by Canaima Lagoon.\n\n**Meals:** breakfast, lunch and dinner.\n\nOptional activities include a helicopter or plane flight over Angel Falls, a trip to Kavak Canyon with a flight over the falls, a trek up Kuravaina Tepui, visits to the Blue Lagoon and Sakaika Lagoon, kayaking and cycling."
    },
